      "id": "",
      "texts": [
        "About Us",
        "At Dodecaa, we stand as a premier distributor of IT hardware, leveraging over two decades of combined expertise in the tech industry. Specializing in comprehensive distribution services, we offer meticulously tested and high-quality IT hardware, covering a wide spectrum from smartphones, networking, cards, memories, processors, laptops,\u00a0 to various other components. Our dedication to excellence resonates through our commitment to delivering superior product quality, exceptional customer service, and a sustainable approach.",
        "As a trusted name in the industry, we cater to both national and international markets, providing competitive prices to distributors worldwide. Our extensive inventory ensures that we have something for everyone, whether you\u2019re seeking budget-friendly bulk deals on specific part number or seeking a reliable wholesaler in the USA."
      ],
      "images": [],
      "buttons": [],
      "forms": []
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "class": [
        "elementor-element",
        "elementor-element-5cc57c6",
        "e-flex",
        "e-con-boxed",
